{"id":510,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"中高一貫で夢と部活を育てる門司学園","feature_description":"門司学園中学校・高等学校は、中学校と高校の6年間を見据えた継続的・系統的な教育活動を行う中高一貫校です。中学校では『分かる→面白い→味のある』授業を掲げ、高校では一人ひとりの大きな夢の実現を学校全体で支えています。部活動も中高それぞれで整備され、学校生活に活気を与えています。学びの幅と学校生活の厚みを感じやすいです。 学校生活の見通しも立てやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":10038,"name":"中学・野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mojigakuen.fku.ed.jp/jh_info/jh_bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10039,"name":"中学・バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mojigakuen.fku.ed.jp/jh_info/jh_bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10040,"name":"中学・バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mojigakuen.fku.ed.jp/jh_info/jh_bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10041,"name":"中学・陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mojigakuen.fku.ed.jp/jh_info/jh_bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10042,"name":"中学・ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mojigakuen.fku.ed.jp/jh_info/jh_bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10043,"name":"中学・吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://mojigakuen.fku.ed.jp/jh_info/jh_bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10044,"name":"中学・英語クラブ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://mojigakuen.fku.ed.jp/jh_info/jh_bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10045,"name":"高校・野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mojigakuen.fku.ed.jp/sh_info/sh_bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10046,"name":"高校・バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mojigakuen.fku.ed.jp/sh_info/sh_bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10047,"name":"高校・水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mojigakuen.fku.ed.jp/sh_info/sh_bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10048,"name":"高校・バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mojigakuen.fku.ed.jp/sh_info/sh_bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10049,"name":"高校・陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mojigakuen.fku.ed.jp/sh_info/sh_bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":1